Mux is a fictional technology brand focused on designing and developing concepts for smartphones, tablets, and other electronic devices. The brand combines modern aesthetics, innovation, and functionality to create unique product concepts with a distinctive visual identity.

On TikTok, @mux.inc serves as Mux’s official social media presence, showcasing fictional devices, original designs, product concepts, and imagined launches. Through its content, Mux brings its vision of technology to life, presenting creative ideas and exploring what future devices could look like.

More than just a collection of fictional products, Mux aims to build a recognizable brand identity, with its own design language, product families, and vision for the future of technology. Every concept is an opportunity to explore new ideas, experiment with different designs, and create a consistent and memorable brand universe.
